---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout
  title="Pluck Sword in Stand Out – How to Get, 77 Rings Raid Drops & Moveset | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Complete guide on how to get Pluck in Roblox STAND OUT. Discover 77 Rings raid fragment drop rates, Blacksmith forging recipes, full sword moveset, and Hamon synergy."
  canonicalPath="items/pluck"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Items', href: '/items/' },
    { label: 'Pluck' }
  ]}
  schemaType="Article"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge & Title -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 border border-amber-200">
        <span>Martial Weapon Style</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>77 Rings Raid Relic</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Pluck Sword in Stand Out
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        The legendary blade of Luck and Pluck from JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Part 1. In Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong>, Pluck is a high-tier melee weapon style that combines rapid thrust combos with lethal Hamon conductivity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Fact Summary Card -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs mb-10">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Item Type</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Weapon Style / Sword</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Acquisition</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-amber-700 mt-1">77 Rings Raid + Forge</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Recommended Level</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Level 35 – 50</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Best Synergy</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-emerald-700 mt-1">Hamon Breathing</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How to Get Pluck -->
    <section class="mb-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        How to Get Pluck in Stand Out
      </h2>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Unlike weapons purchased directly from general store merchants, Pluck must be assembled from ancient relic fragments dropped in the <strong>77 Rings Raid</strong> located in the Honolulu underground canal:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs">1</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-slate-900">Clear the 77 Rings Raid:</strong>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
                Queue for the 77 Rings Raid dungeon (Level 35+). Each successful clear guarantees <strong>1 to 2 Pluck Fragments</strong> from the completion rewards chest.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs">2</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-slate-900">Gather Forging Materials:</strong>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
                Collect <strong>3x Pluck Fragments</strong>, <strong>5x Steel Ingots</strong> (smelted from iron ore), and <strong>$25,000 Dalas</strong> cash.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs">3</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-slate-900">Visit the Master Blacksmith:</strong>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">
                Locate the Master Blacksmith near the industrial docks. Select the Pluck Reforging dialogue option to permanently unlock the Pluck weapon style.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pluck Moveset Table -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Pluck Moveset &amp; Key Abilities
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 uppercase text-[11px] font-bold">
              <th class="p-4">Key</th>
              <th class="p-4">Move Name</th>
              <th class="p-4">Cooldown</th>
              <th class="p-4">Combat Effect</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-amber-700">[Z]</td>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Piercing Thrust</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-500">6.0s</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-600">High-velocity straight lunge. Bypasses 50% enemy guard block and inflicts bleed damage.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-amber-700">[X]</td>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Sword Dance</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-500">9.5s</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Three-hit sweeping arc. Excellent AOE mob clearance for raids and defensive disengages.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-amber-700">[C]</td>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Sunlight Yellow Infusion</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-500">14.0s</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Enchants blade with solar energy. Converts attacks to Hamon element (200% damage vs Vampires).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-mono font-bold text-amber-700">[V]</td>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Severing Leap</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-500">16.0s</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Aerial leap followed by a crushing downward cleave. Breaks enemy posture and knocks down targets.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hamon Synergy Box -->
    <section class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-amber-950 mb-2">Pluck &amp; Hamon Discipline Synergy</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900/90 leading-relaxed">
        Pluck is one of the only weapons in STAND OUT with natural <strong>Hamon Conductivity</strong>. When wielded by a character who has unlocked Hamon breathing from Lisa Lisa, Pluck's stamina consumption is reduced by 25%, and the <em>Sunlight Yellow Infusion</em> skill extends its duration by an additional 6 seconds.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross Navigation Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <a
        href="/guides/raids/77-rings/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Raid Guide</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">77 Rings Raid Walkthrough →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Boss tactics, wave breakdowns, and fragment farming methods.</p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/hamon/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Style Overview</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">Hamon Breathing Guide →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Learn Hamon bar breathing techniques and sunlight overdrive stats.</p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/items/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Item Catalog</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">All Items &amp; Materials →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Browse Steel Ingots, Scrap Metal, and crafting bench recipes.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
